# Design iterations: intake-files/ holds the received files exactly as delivered
# (never edited), and each iteration's README.md is the field table the
# `pnpm iteration:*` commands write, kept byte-identical in format with
# clinozy-be's — a Prettier rewrite (via lint-staged at commit) would change both.
iterations/*/intake-files/
iterations/*/README.md
# The templates `pnpm iteration:new` fills, byte-identical to clinozy-be's
# tooling/iterations/templates/ so `--both` writes the same files from either repo.
tooling/iterations/templates/
# pnpm owns the lockfile format — Prettier's YAML rules must never rewrite it
# (lint-staged's *.yaml pattern would otherwise format it on dependency commits).
pnpm-lock.yaml
